<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Futuris extends Elders bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Futuris extends Elders bid.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Futuris Corp Ltd said on Monday it had extended its offer for Elders Australia Ltd for a further 28 days until November 25.</p>
<p>Futuris said at the start of the bid in July it was entitled to 30.05 percent of Elders shares.</p>
<p>It said it is now entitled to 83.20 percent of Elders shares and there are less than 300 shareholders on the Elders register who had not accepted the bid. It said of those 275 have marketable parcels of 100 or more Elders shares.</p>
<p>Futuris us offering 10 of its shares for every nine Elders shares plus 23 cents per Elders share.  </p>
<p>The bid values Elders around A$280 million.</p>
<p>At 1.40 p.m. (0240 GMT), Futuris shares were two cents up at A$1.54, while Elders shares were two cents down A$1.88.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
